%N A204895 The prime q such that n divides p-q, where p>q is the least prime for which such a prime q exists.
%C A204895 For a guide to related sequences, see A204892.
%H A204895 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A204895/b204895.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%t A204895 (See the program at A204892.)
%o A204895 (PARI) A204895(n) = forprime(p=3,,forprime(q=2,p-1,if(!((p-q)%n), return(q)))); \\ _Antti Karttunen_, Nov 26 2026
%Y A204895 Cf. A000040, A204892, A204894 (the corresponding primes p).
%Y A204895 Cf. also A204903 (similar sequence, but q has to be an odd prime).
%K A204895 nonn,changed
%O A204895 1,1
